of the building. From one of those windows, a girl is trying to escape her apartment as two men from the apartment below come to help her. The video becomes nail-biting when the two men stand on the ledge of their narrow window. They are also seen holding on to the frame of the window to support the girl. After struggling for several minutes, the girl tries to climb down to escape the fire. Meanwhile, the men are seen holding her legs and then her body carefully. The 52-second video went viral on several Reddit subgroups where the footage of the miraculous rescue shocked viewers. An eyewitness to the incident told 360 TV channel that the men, who saved the girl, were also injured in the process. After the video went viral, the Ministry of Emergency Situations are looking out for the two men to thank them for their heroic act.", "language": "en", "metadata": {"sentence_id": "1"}, "frames": [{"name": "Rescuing", "roles": [{"name": "Patient", "filler": "girl", "idxs": [9, 9]}, {"name": "Patient", "filler": "a girl from a burning building", "idxs": [24, 29]}, {"name": "Harmful_situation", "filler": "from burning apartment in Moscow", "idxs": [10, 14]}, {"name": "Agent", "filler": "Two men in Russia", "idxs": [15, 18]}], "idxs": [8, 8], "activation": "rescue"}, {"name": "Fire_burning", "roles": [{"name": "Fuel", "filler": "building", "idxs": [29, 29]}], "idxs": [28, 28], "activation": "burning"}, {"name": "People", "roles": [{"name": "Person", "filler": "men", "idxs": [3, 3]}], "idxs": [3, 3], "activation": "men"}, {"name": "Buildings", "roles": [{"name": "Building", "filler": "building", "idxs": [29, 29]}], "idxs": [29, 29], "activation": "building"}, {"name": "People", "roles": [{"name": "Person", "filler": "men", "idxs": [16, 16]}, {"name": "Descriptor", "filler": "in Russia", "idxs": [17, 18]}], "idxs": [16, 16], "activation": "men"}, {"name": "Dead_or_alive", "roles": [{"name": "Figure", "filler": "their", "idxs": [5, 5]}, {"name": "Protagonist", "filler": "lives", 